<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Winged Flight</ansi> mutation

Great membranous wings unfurl from your back and the ground releases
its claim on you. You move above the fight -- always aloft, no command
needed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (always on)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Hollow Bones and a tail

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  You strike down at earthbound foes from a superior angle and are
  far harder for them to touch; you break away from a fight almost
  effortlessly; and you glide over terrain, so travel barely tires
  you. Against others who fly, the aerial advantage cancels out.

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Reaching flight means hollowing your bones, so your lightened frame
  takes wounds more easily

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
